# Build context exclusions for the operator console image (ARCHITECTURE.md section 8.2).
#
# The `web` service builds from ./frontend as its own context, so the repository-root .dockerignore
# does not apply here — this file is what keeps the context honest.
#
# node_modules is the one that matters. The Dockerfile runs `npm ci` and only then `COPY . .`; with
# the host's node_modules in the context, that copy lands on top of the install the image just
# performed. On a Windows host that means Linux binaries replaced by Windows ones, and a build that
# fails inside the container for reasons visible nowhere in the source.
node_modules

# Build output — regenerated inside the image.
dist
.vite

# Test and tooling artefacts, none of which the production bundle needs.
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
e2e

# Local state.
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
